          "text": "Ŵandu 288 ŵagaŵidwe pakukuya maŵasa mu makuga 24 gakwana 12, ni mlongola jwa likuga lililyose. Awu ni mndandanda wakwe muŵaŵelele jemanjajo pa masengo:",
